POUR LANE :I
RENDS 320 - ( :I - 1 ) * 160
FIN

POUR COLOR :I
SI :I = 1 [ RENDS 1 ]
SI :I = 2 [ RENDS 3 ]
SI :I = 3 [ RENDS 4 ]
SI :I = 4 [ RENDS 5 ]
RENDS 15
FIN

POUR TRACK
FCFG [ 56 142 60 ]
FIXETORTUE 0 CT FCC 7 LC
FXY -760 -480 BC FXY -760 480 LC
FXY 760 -480 BC FXY 760 480 LC
FIN

POUR SETHORSES
REPETEPOUR [ I 1 5 ] [
FIXETORTUE :I FCC COLOR :I SPRITE 3 LC FXY -780 LANE :I MT
]
FIN

POUR ASKBET
ECRIS [ BET ON A HORSE FROM 1 TO 5 ]
DONNE "K ASCII LISCAR
SI :K > 48 [ SI :K < 54 [ RENDS :K - 48 ] ]
ECRIS [ PLEASE TYPE A DIGIT FROM 1 TO 5 ]
RENDS ASKBET
FIN

POUR COUNTDOWN
FIXETORTUE 0 FCC 7 LC
FXY -160 455 ETIQUETTE "3 ATTENDS 60
FXY -100 455 ETIQUETTE "2 ATTENDS 60
FXY -40 455 ETIQUETTE "1 ATTENDS 60
FXY 20 455 ETIQUETTE [ START! ] ATTENDS 60
FIN

POUR RACE
DONNE "WINNER 0
TANTQUE [ :WINNER = 0 ] [
REPETEPOUR [ I 1 5 ] [
FIXETORTUE :I
FXY XCOR + ( HASARD 0 5 ) YCOR
SPRITE 3 + RESTE ENT ( ( XCOR + 800 ) / 12 ) 2
SI XCOR > 730 [ DONNE "WINNER :I ]
]
ATTENDS 1
]
RENDS :WINNER
FIN

POUR START
VE CT
FORMES
TRACK
SETHORSES
DONNE "BET ASKBET
COUNTDOWN
DONNE "WINNER RACE
ECRIS ( PHRASE [ HORSE ] :WINNER [ WINS THE RACE ! ] )
SI :WINNER = :BET [ ECRIS [ YOU WIN ! ] ] [ ECRIS [ YOU LOSE . ] ]
FIN
